DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Music & Dance\\n\\nGet ready to sing and dance with M
 iss Kym! Miss Kym’s Sing-A-Long is a joyful\, interactive music experien
 ce created especially for young children and their families. Through origi
 nal songs\, movement\, and plenty of audience participation\, Miss Kym inv
 ites families to move their bodies\, use their imaginations\, and make mus
 ic together.\nTime:11am\nSpace is limited! Book your tickets now\; this pr
 ogram is included in museum admission.\n*Events and dates are subject to c
 hange.\nAbout the play partner:\nKymberly is a GRAMMY nominated singer\, s
 ongwriter\, musician and early childhood music educator from Los Angeles\,
  CA. Her songbook mixes modern lyrics with the jazz\, gospel\, and soulful
  pop sounds of the 70s and 80s\, giving rise to a celebration of childhood
  that bridges generations.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/eve
 nts/music-with-kymberly-stewart/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
