 h Thursday of each month from 5-7 pm (after we close to general admission)
 \nSpace is Limited.\nOn these nights\, we dim the lights in the museum\, t
 urn off the sounds\, and offer a limited capacity of 250 guests. Staff are
  happy and ready to assist with providing various materials\, including 
 noise-cancelling headphones\, fidget toys\, sunglasses\, and weighted mate
 rials for your convenience. \nRSVP COMING SOON\n*Registration is required
  and opens two weeks before each event. \nAbout the Play Partners:\nArriv
 ing in a Music Mobile van full of instruments\, Philharmonic Society docen
 ts introduce the symphony orchestra and musical concepts with an engaging 
 30-minute presentation and instrument petting zoo\, giving children the op
 portunity to try out different instruments in this hands-on experience. 
 \nhttps://www.philharmonicsociety.org/education-community/education-progra
 ms/elementary/music-mobile  \n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\n&nbsp\;\\n\\nMore info: 
 https://www.pretendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-5/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/neurodivergent-family-night-5/
